@HostUrl = https://localhost:7297

### 1. Successful hall creation (with VIP zone)
POST {{HostUrl}}/api/halls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "IMAX Hall",
  "rows": [
    {
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "segments": [
        { "firstSeatNumber": 1, "seatCount": 20, "category": "Standard" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "rowNumber": 2,
      "segments": [
        { "firstSeatNumber": 1, "seatCount": 9, "category": "Standard" },
        { "firstSeatNumber": 10, "seatCount": 2, "category": "Vip" },
        { "firstSeatNumber": 12, "seatCount": 9, "category": "Standard" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Validation error (Empty name)
POST {{HostUrl}}/api/halls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "rows": [
    {
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "segments": [
        { "firstSeatNumber": 1, "seatCount": 10, "category": "Standard" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Domain invariant error (Seat overlap in a row)
POST {{HostUrl}}/api/halls
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "IMAX Hall",
  "rows": [
    {
      "rowNumber": 1,
      "segments": [
        { "firstSeatNumber": 1, "seatCount": 10, "category": "Standard" },
        { "firstSeatNumber": 5, "seatCount": 5, "category": "Vip" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}